{"version":1,"content":"<p>MIRROR成員邱士縉（Stanley）與拍拖9年李炘頤（Alina）共諧連理，日前於峇里舉行婚禮，一對新人昨晚（27日）返港，暫未度蜜月，新郎哥今晚（28日）復工出席《我阿爹想旅行》慶功宴，盼將新婚喜慶帶動票房成績更好。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:21:14.579450+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:46:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:38:10.842909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:18:18.468271+00:00","content_hash":"8c004cec6111f40797f8567d6f5e87cacd682c187bd42d46313ce1b863031cae","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}